                            <div className="flex justify-between items-center"><span className="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 font-medium">Đổi giao diện Sáng/Tối</span><kbd className="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-700 rounded border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-500 font-bold text-xs">Ctrl + L</kbd></div>
                            <div className="flex justify-between items-center"><span className="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 font-medium">Lưu File dữ liệu (.json)</span><kbd className="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-700 rounded border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-500 font-bold text-xs">S</kbd></div>
                            <div className="flex justify-between items-center"><span className="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 font-medium">Toàn màn hình</span><kbd className="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-700 rounded border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-500 font-bold text-xs">F</kbd></div>
                        </div>
                    </section>
                    <section className="space-y-4">
                        <h4 className="font-black text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-widest text-xs flex items-center gap-2"><Info className="w-4 h-4"/> Chế độ Giảng dạy</h4>
                        <div className="space-y-3">
                            <div className="flex justify-between items-center"><span className="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 font-medium">Hiện/Ẩn đáp án</span><kbd className="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-700 rounded border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-500 font-bold text-xs">A</kbd></div>
                            <div className="flex justify-between items-center"><span className="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 font-medium">Bảng viết tay</span><kbd className="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-700 rounded border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-500 font-bold text-xs">B</kbd></div>
                            <div className="flex justify-between items-center"><span className="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 font-medium">Quay số/Chia nhóm</span><kbd className="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-700 rounded border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-500 font-bold text-xs">R</kbd></div>
                            <div className="flex justify-between items-center"><span className="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 font-medium">Bấm giờ thảo luận</span><kbd className="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-700 rounded border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-500 font-bold text-xs">T</kbd></div>
                        </div>
                    </section>
                    <section className="space-y-4 md:col-span-2 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700">
                        <h4 className="font-black text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-widest text-xs flex items-center gap-2"><Info className="w-4 h-4"/> Điều hướng Slide/Câu hỏi</h4>
                        <div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                            <div className="flex justify-between items-center"><span className="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 font-medium">Tiếp theo</span><kbd className="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-700 rounded border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-500 font-bold text-xs">→</kbd></div>
                            <div className="flex justify-between items-center"><span className="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 font-medium">Quay lại</span><kbd className="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-700 rounded border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-500 font-bold text-xs">←</kbd></div>
                            <div className="flex justify-between items-center"><span className="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 font-medium">Phóng to chữ (Zoom)</span><kbd className="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-700 rounded border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-500 font-bold text-xs">+</kbd></div>
                            <div className="flex justify-between items-center"><span className="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 font-medium">Thu nhỏ chữ (Zoom)</span><kbd className="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-700 rounded border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-500 font-bold text-xs">-</kbd></div>
                        </div>
                    </section>
                </div>
                <div className="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900 p-6 text-center">
                    <p className="text-xs text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest italic">Lưu ý: Phím tắt không hoạt động khi đang nhập liệu vào ô văn bản.</p>
                </div>
